  "subTitleDesc": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CE09139",
    "sub_id": "52798",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "sub_title": "EDA 流程與相關演算法",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "本課程廣泛而全面地介紹了整個 EDA 流程，包括邏輯合成、物理設計和測試。它還涵蓋 EDA 相關的資料結構、演算法和架構。演算法技術包括二元決策圖、KL/FM 的圖分割、模擬退火的最佳化、最短路徑演算法、Steiner 樹最小化技術等。這些演算法的應用解決了大規模晶片的邏輯設計和物理設計中遇到的一些實際問題（例如合成、分區、佈局規劃、配置和佈線問題）。",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "EDA電子設計自動化導論",
    "sub_ename": "NTRODUCTION TO ELECTRONIC DESIGN AUTOMATION",
    "describe_ch": "在半導體產業，電子設計自動化（EDA）被視為「晶片之母」。本課程廣泛而全面地介紹了整個 EDA 流程，包括邏輯合成、物理設計和測試。它還涵蓋 EDA 相關的資料結構、演算法和架構。演算法技術包括二元決策圖、KL/FM 的圖分割、模擬退火的最佳化、最短路徑演算法、Steiner 樹最小化技術等。這些演算法的應用解決了大規模晶片的邏輯設計和物理設計中遇到的一些實際問題（例如合成、分區、佈局規劃、配置和佈線問題）。由於奈米設計的挑戰以及機器學習和人工智慧的創新，本課程還調查和研究了一些高級主題。本課程的學生將學習IC設計工具的工作原理並獲得整合理論知識和實踐技能的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "In the semiconductor industry,electronic design automation (EDA) is seen as the “mother of chips.” This course provides a broad and comprehensive coverage of the entire EDA flow including logic synthesis, physical design, and testing. It also covers EDA related data structures, algorithms, and architectures. The algorithmic techniques are binary decision diagram, KL/FM-based graph partitioning, simulated annealing based optimization, shortest path algorithms, Steiner tree minimization techniques, etc. The application of these algorithms solve some of the real-world problems encountered during logic design and physical design of large scale chips (e.g. synthesis, partition, floorplanning, placement, and routing problems). Due to the challenges in nanometer design and innovation in machine learning and artificial intelligence, the course also surveys and studies some advanced topics .Students in this course will learn how IC design tools work and gain the ability to integrate theoretical knowledge and practical skills.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
